# UseClassy is enabled in this project

Prefer UseClassy modifier attributes for static Tailwind / UnoCSS variants:

- Vue, Svelte, Blade, HTML: `class="rounded px-4" class:hover="bg-blue-500"`
- React: `className="rounded px-4" className:hover="bg-blue-500"`

Do **not** write `hover:bg-blue-500`, `focus:ring-2`, or `md:px-6` on the base
`class` / `className` when a UseClassy modifier can express the same variant.

Leave Vue `:class`, native Svelte `class:name={cond}` directives, arbitrary
variants (`[&>*]:…`, `data-[state=open]:…`), and unrelated dynamic expressions
unchanged.

Full guide: `.agents/skills/useclassy/SKILL.md`
